# Secret chat / game codes

## Bare `67`
Never recite the Golden/Diamond Night speech. Short ack only.

## First secret word: **попугай** (also **parrot**, short **кеша** / **тоты**)
- Primary: Russian **попугай**. English **parrot** OK.
- Shorter aliases in-game: **кеша**, **тоты**.
- Explain **once** in chat. On repeat: short ack only («ок, помню») — never the same unlock speech again.
- Bare `67` never dumps Golden Night.

## Second secret word: **искра** (also **iskra**, **spark**)
- In-game: shift **77**, coat `secret-iskra`, fireworks burst, theme `iskra`.
- In chat: short ack only («ок, помню»). Never re-dump unlock steps or surprise speech.

## Personal secrets
If the user shares a personal secret, keep it confidential. Never put it in commits, rules, or public text.
